where there is meritocracy, no one is forced, no one is forced,

910
00:58:36,360 --> 00:58:43,274
when Pakistanis flourish in good environment, you see, I know so many doctors,

911
00:58:43,354 --> 00:58:46,821
they are doing Mashallah so well.

912
00:58:46,901 --> 00:58:51,450
Similarly, people in business, people in real estate.

913
00:58:51,530 --> 00:58:54,468
People have become interested in technology.

914
00:58:54,548 --> 00:58:56,818
I meet a lot of people, Mashallah.

915
00:58:56,898 --> 00:58:59,570
I'm ever so grateful to work the way I do what I do.

916
00:58:59,650 --> 00:59:01,250
I agree with you, staying outside is not easy.

917
00:59:01,330 --> 00:59:06,065
And I get to meet a lot of good people and that makes me happy and obviously,

918
00:59:06,145 --> 00:59:07,946
it gives me inspiration.

919
00:59:08,026 --> 00:59:09,659
So that is absolutely true.

920
00:59:09,739 --> 00:59:11,330
That's what I understand.

921
00:59:19,180 --> 00:59:21,460
The situation becomes tense.

922
00:59:21,540 --> 00:59:23,860
Who wants to stay away from family?

923
00:59:23,940 --> 00:59:25,860
And no one wants to go out of the country.

924
00:59:25,940 --> 00:59:33,210
These are the constraints and the circumstances that force a person to make such a big,

925
00:59:33,290 --> 00:59:39,220
drastic decision, where he leaves his nest, leaves everything and starts from zero.

926
00:59:39,300 --> 00:59:40,660
It's not easy.

927
00:59:40,740 --> 00:59:42,660
Look, we have a lot of privilege here.

928
00:59:42,740 --> 00:59:45,140
We have a home.

929
00:59:45,340 --> 00:59:49,260
There are people to look after, you know, there's no problem with food or drinking.

930
00:59:49,340 --> 00:59:52,020
It's a very lavish living here.

931
00:59:52,100 --> 00:59:54,500
I'm telling you, it's a very lavish living, whatever it is.

932
00:59:54,580 --> 00:59:58,700
But the reality kick is that because then you're on your own.

933
00:59:58,780 --> 01:00:04,100
It's like a bird pushes its child one day, saying, you're on your own then.

934
01:00:04,180 --> 01:00:05,180
So that's it.

935
01:00:05,260 --> 01:00:08,460
The rest of the Middle East is also that the poor are exploited all their lives.

936
01:00:08,540 --> 01:00:11,060
Then they have to come back here.

937
01:00:12,160 --> 01:00:14,080
Future doesn't exist. It's very sad.

938
01:00:14,160 --> 01:00:16,080
So I understand your grievances.

939
01:00:16,160 --> 01:00:19,080
I request people not to give overseas such a tough time.

940
01:00:19,160 --> 01:00:23,080
They are among us. And they are among us and they are helpless.

941
01:00:23,160 --> 01:00:30,080
So if you are sending money to your parents, to your siblings, at least through a proper channel.

942
01:00:30,160 --> 01:00:34,080
Tax is being paid. It's coming to the country. Otherwise, there is no problem with the Hundi.

943
01:00:34,160 --> 01:00:39,160
Make a call, it is collected from home and dropped at home. And it is spent less.

944
01:00:39,430 --> 01:00:40,906
But people, despite that,

945
01:00:40,986 --> 01:00:47,150
they choose the right way because they are eager to do the process in a lawful way.

946
01:00:47,230 --> 01:00:54,150
So I really admire those who go through the painful process and choose to do the right thing.

947
01:00:54,230 --> 01:01:00,150
So don't send hate on them. And if you think they are such traitors, then why are you renewing your passport?

948
01:01:00,230 --> 01:01:06,760
Why are you giving IELTS exams? Why are you looking for a scholarship? Why are you emailing me that you want to go abroad? Do you want to become a traitor too?

949
01:01:06,840 --> 01:01:10,600
So let's leave this labeling. There is no traitor in leaving the country.

950
01:01:10,680 --> 01:01:16,860
On the contrary, I think that overseas loves the country more because then he remembers what he left.

951
01:01:16,940 --> 01:01:22,080
He gets more feelings. That's why we see that Pakistan is so hyped up about the country.

952
01:01:22,160 --> 01:01:27,040
Although they shouldn't give a damn. In a sense, they will go, they will go.

953
01:01:27,120 --> 01:01:31,380
But there they feel more that we have left something. We had a very good life.

954
01:01:31,460 --> 01:01:33,210
So that's it. You give some, you take some.

955
01:01:33,290 --> 01:01:34,210
You kill some, you take some.

956
01:01:34,290 --> 01:01:38,210
Rest, your cases are absolutely correct and I totally concur with you.

957
01:01:38,290 --> 01:01:39,210
And this is wrong.

958
01:01:39,290 --> 01:01:40,210
You should not give frustration.

959
01:01:40,290 --> 01:01:44,210
And don't vent your frustration on overseas Pakistanis.

960
01:01:44,290 --> 01:01:45,210
Send them love.

961
01:01:45,290 --> 01:01:46,210
Thank you so much.

962
